{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapsnapshotter"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@interface"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapSnapshotter"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSObject","text":"NSObject"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/StaticSnapshotExample"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can change the snapshotter’s options at any time and reuse the snapshotter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for multiple distinct snapshots; however, the snapshotter can only generate one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"snapshot at a time. If you need to generate multiple snapshots concurrently,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create multiple snapshotter objects."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For an interactive map, use the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class. Both "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are compatible with offline packs managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From a snapshot, you can obtain an image and convert geographic coordinates to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the image’s coordinate space in order to superimpose markers and overlays. If"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you do not need offline map functionality, you can use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Snapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" class in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/mapbox\/MapboxStatic.swift\/","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to generate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"static map images with overlays."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"code":["let camera = MLNMapCamera(lookingAtCenter: CLLocationCoordinate2D(latitude: 37.7184, longitude:","-122.4365), altitude: 100, pitch: 20, heading: 0)","","let options = MLNMapSnapshotOptions(styleURL: MLNStyle.satelliteStreetsStyleURL, camera: camera,","size: CGSize(width: 320, height: 480)) options.zoomLevel = 10","","let snapshotter = MLNMapSnapshotter(options: options)","snapshotter.start { (snapshot, error) in","    if let error = error {","        fatalError(error.localizedDescription)","    }","","    image = snapshot?.image","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":4,"anchor":"Related-examples","type":"heading","text":"Related examples"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Create a static map snapshot, learn how to use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to generate a static image based on an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object’s style, camera, and view bounds."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"title":"MLNMapSnapshotter","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapSnapshotter"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"symbolKind":"class","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapSnapshotter","roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapSnapshotter"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" generates static raster images of the map. Each snapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"image depicts a portion of a map defined by an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotOptions","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you provide. The snapshotter generates an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshot","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asynchronously, calling "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotterDelegate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" methods if defined, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passing it into a completion handler once tiles and other resources needed for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the snapshot are finished loading."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter\/delegate","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProj